feat: Linux release builds + smarter CUDA path detection. build.sh now searches /usr/local/cuda, /opt/cuda, /usr/lib/cuda for CUDA_PATH (checking for include/cuda.h), then finds libcudart_static.a in CUDA_PATH/lib64 or gcc multiarch dir, adding -L to RUSTFLAGS. Tauri bundling defaults to deb-only on Linux (AppImage was taking hours compressing 1.3GB WebKit deps on single core). release.yml gets ubuntu-22.04 matrix entry building deb+rpm.
